# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill it in, OR just paste the key
# directly into src/components/BookShow.js — either works.
#
# Get the key at https://web3forms.com — type omdagur1@gmail.com into the
# "Create Access Key" box and they email you the key straight away.
#
# Note: anything prefixed REACT_APP_ is baked into the public JS bundle.
# That is fine here — Web3Forms access keys are meant to be public and can
# only ever deliver mail to the address they were created for.
REACT_APP_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
